Subject: [PATCH 09/30] BlueOS: SystemUI: Halo clock fixes

The halo sits in its own room above the hours instead of over the digits, the small clock (notifications, AOD) gets one too, and a clock color picked by the user is used for all digits and the halo. Default system font: Nunito.

